---
// The left half of this panel stays empty: the shared portrait
// (SharedPortrait.astro) rests there after gliding in from the hero.
---

<section class="section about" id="about" aria-label="About">
  <h2 class="sr-only">About</h2>
  <div class="about-content">
    <div class="ab-body">
      <p class="ab-hook reveal reveal-x" style="--i:0">Shaped by business, technology and media.</p>
      <p class="reveal reveal-x" style="--i:1">
        I am interested in how digital products are structured, how they guide people and how they
        create trust. For me, design is not only about the surface, but about clarity, usability and
        the decisions that make an experience feel effortless.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal reveal-x" style="--i:2">
        What fascinates me about UX is that good design often goes unnoticed. When it works, people
        simply understand where they are, what they can do and what happens next. That is the kind of
        design I want to create: useful, trustworthy and calm, but with enough character to feel distinct.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal reveal-x" style="--i:3">
        Outside of design, I am drawn to experiences that combine structure, atmosphere and detail,
        whether in games, movies or cooking. I like it when many small choices come together to create
        something people remember.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-foot">
      <div class="ab-foot-col reveal" style="--i:3">
        <p class="ab-foot-label">Education</p>
        <p class="ab-foot-line">M.Sc. Digital Media &mdash; <span class="ab-school">TH&nbsp;Brandenburg</span></p>
        <p class="ab-foot-line">B.Sc. Social Media Systems &mdash; <span class="ab-school">TH&nbsp;Mittelhessen</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-foot-col reveal" style="--i:4">
        <p class="ab-foot-label">Languages</p>
        <p class="ab-foot-line">German &mdash; native</p>
        <p class="ab-foot-line">English &mdash; C1</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-foot-col reveal" style="--i:5">
        <p class="ab-foot-label">Location</p>
        <p class="ab-foot-line">Berlin Metropolitan Area</p>
        <p class="ab-foot-line"><span class="soft">(open to relocate)</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    width: 100vw;
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  /* the whole right column (intro + footer) is one vertically-centred flex
     stack, so the footer always sits below the body with a real gap — it can
     never overlap the paragraphs on short or narrow desktop viewports */
  .about-content {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50vw;
    right: 6vw;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(26px, 4vh, 56px);
    /* headroom so the vertically-centred column never rises under the fixed
       navbar (top-right) on short viewports, plus matching bottom breathing room */
    padding: clamp(92px, 13vh, 150px) 0 clamp(56px, 8vh, 104px);
    z-index: 20;
  }

  .ab-body {
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  /* scoped under .ab-body so it beats the `.ab-body p` body style */
  .ab-body .ab-hook {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 1.9vw, 27px);
    line-height: 1.36;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ab-body p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: none;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.78;
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }

  .ab-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* footer strip, divided by thin rules — sits in the flow below the intro */
  .about-foot {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr 1.05fr;
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .ab-school {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ab-foot-col {
    padding-right: 22px;
  }

  .ab-foot-col + .ab-foot-col {
    padding-left: 22px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .ab-foot-label {
    margin: 0 0 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .ab-foot-line {
    margin: 0 0 5px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .ab-foot-line:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ab-foot-line .soft {
    color: var(--color-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px), (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about-content {
      position: static;
      left: auto;
      right: auto;
      display: block;
      gap: 0;
      padding: 12vh 7vw 10vh;
    }

    .ab-body {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .about-foot {
      margin-top: 40px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .ab-foot-col {
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .ab-foot-col + .ab-foot-col {
      padding-top: 22px;
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }
  }
</style>
